 is a full-length, vertically oriented photograph of a young woman posing in a lush, rural landscape. The image is characterized by vibrant greens and a peaceful, outdoorsy mood.\n\n### **Subject: The Woman**\n*   **Position and Pose:** The woman stands centrally in the frame, facing the camera directly. She is standing on a narrow dirt path at the edge of a field. Her pose is deliberate and graceful; she holds the brim of her wide straw hat with both hands, her elbows slightly bent and pointed outward. Her body is slightly angled, emphasizing a slender, hourglass figure.\n*   **Expression:** She has a gentle, pleasant smile and looks directly into the lens with a relaxed and friendly expression.\n*   **Physical Features:** She has long, straight, dark hair that falls over her shoulders and down her back. Her skin is fair.\n*   **Attire:**\n    *   **Top:** She wears a form-fitting, sleeveless, cropped tank top in a medium-blue color. The top features a white teardrop or polka-dot pattern and has thin spaghetti straps with a sweetheart neckline.\n    *   **Bottom:** She is wearing high-waisted, light-wash blue denim jeans. The jeans are tight through the hips and thighs and feature a slight flare at the bottom with small vertical slits on the inner hems.\n    *   **Footwear:** On her feet are white, open-toed sandals or slides.\n    *   **Accessories:** She wears a wide-brimmed straw hat that has a white fabric crown. A delicate gold or silver necklace with a small pendant is visible around her neck, and a simple thin bracelet is on her left wrist.\n\n### **Environment and Background**\n*   **Foreground:** A narrow, reddish-brown dirt path runs from the bottom left corner toward the center of the image. The path is bordered by several large, smooth, rounded stones in shades of grey and tan. To the left of the path, tall blades of green grass grow.\n*   **Midground:** The woman stands at the edge of a vibrant, bright green rice field. The rice stalks are dense and reach up to her waist. Some of the stalks show developing yellowish grain heads (panicles) drooping slightly. Immediately behind the rice field is a row of taller, darker green plants that appear to be corn (maize), with visible broad leaves and tassels.\n*   **Background:** Behind the crops, a steep hillside rises, covered in a dense, lush forest. The foliage is a mix of various shades of green, suggesting a variety of trees and perhaps bamboo. The trees are packed tightly together, creating a solid wall of greenery.\n*   **Sky:** Only a small sliver of the sky is visible at the very top of the image. It appears pale, almost white or a very light grey, suggesting an overcast day.\n\n### **Lighting and Composition**\n*   **Lighting:** The lighting is bright and diffused, typical of a cloudy day or late afternoon. There are no harsh, direct shadows on the woman’s face or the landscape, which creates a soft, even glow across the entire scene.\n*   **Color Palette:** The image is dominated by various shades of green—from the neon-bright green of the rice to the deep forest greens of the background. These are contrasted by the blues of the woman's outfit and the earthy browns and greys of the path and stones.\n*   **Composition:** The woman is the clear focal point, positioned in the center of the frame. The diagonal line of the dirt path in the lower-left helps lead the viewer's eye toward her. The layers of the landscape (path, rice field, corn stalks, forested hill) provide a sense of depth and scale.\n\n\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [598.0718383789062, 261.8549499511719], "pos": [634.2850341796875, 882.6940307617188], "id": 16, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyroll", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": 